WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.170
Something unique about CMU
is that they have something called StuCo

2
00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.905
or student-taught courses.

3
00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:09.609
Like the name suggests, these courses
are taught by actual CMU students.

4
00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:14.714
There are a variety of topics offered,
such as Taylor Swift,

5
00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:18.518
Star Wars,
competitive Pokemon and cooking classes.

6
00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.655
Personally, I took the competitive Pokemon
class and the cooking class,

7
00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:27.093
and I was able to not only learn
real world applicable skills that I use

8
00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.829
when living on my own,
but also some cool, fun facts

9
00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.631
about Pokemon
that I didn't even know existed.

